To get the overall mean salary, compute the weighted average:

\[
\frac{28500(128) + 22500(32)}{128+32}
= \frac{3648000 + 720000}{160}
= \frac{4368000}{160}
= 27300
\]

So the correct choice is **(D) $27,300**. I would not be misled by the high-point option **(C)**, so I’d answer C only rarely.

